          interpretation: 'PE2 uses RD 65000:102. XR carries the VPN extended communities over iBGP. The CE continues exchanging ordinary IPv4/IPv6 unicast in its own session. The PE exports admitted VRF routes with the RD, RT and allocated service label. Keep the PE next hop through the RR.',
